      "role": "user",
      "content": "the self-care stuff feels like a joke when you look at the reality. like, she has to work a full time job and then come home and basically parent me. it’s not just \"tiring\" for her, it's like my existence is actively stealing her life away. i just feel so guilty seeing her do everything i should be doing for myself.",
