    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just keep thinking about if things were different. if i wasn't here, she wouldn't have to deal with all this. she could actually just live her life, go out, sleep, be free. it almost feels like the most decent thing i could do is just stop being a problem for her to solve.",
